OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,7,     Gtoday celebrating the legacy of
OL,8,     Gthe conductor Charles Mackerras.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GJanacek's Glagolitic Mass and
OL,11,     GSmetana's Ma vlast conducted by
OL,12,     GCharles Mackerras in archive
OL,13,     Gconcert performances to celebrate
OL,14,     Gthe Australian conductor's
OL,15,     Gcentenary today.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: Opera on a Plate
OL,17,     GItalian food and Italian opera -
OL,18,     Ga marriage of music and menus
OL,19,     Gthat combine perfectly in this
OL,20,     Gseries which looks at Italy's
OL,21,     Grich cultural history. With
OL,22,     GWalter Iuzzolino.
